choice-effects.json is derived from choice and stat tables maintained by
Shinycolors Wiki contributors: https://shinycolors.wiki/

Source page URLs are recorded in each group's "source" field. The imported
tables have been filtered and converted to JSON by script/updateChoiceEffects.py.
Verified transcription corrections also cite the Japanese Shinycolors Wiki:
https://wikiwiki.jp/shinycolors/

Shinycolors Wiki publishes its text under the Creative Commons
Attribution-NonCommercial-ShareAlike 4.0 International License:
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/

Game dialogue and character names belong to their respective rights holders.

Verified whole-table replacements and supplementary records also cite Japanese
Shinycolors Wiki contributors: https://wikiwiki.jp/shinycolors/
Their source URLs are preserved per group or choice. The English Wiki's CC
notice is not a blanket license for game text or other third-party material.
